# Phase 1: Asset Class Database

## Overview

Create a static JSON database of 15-20 micro-capital asset classes with historical ROI distributions, structural properties, and founder-fit tags. This is the foundation — all subsequent components consume this data.

## Requirements

- Functional: JSON file with 15-20 asset classes, each with ROI distribution (P10/P25/P50/P75/P90), time-to-first-dollar, sleep test, leverage class, failure rates, capital tiers, founder fit tags
- Non-functional: Every numeric claim tagged [K]/[T]/[?] with data source. Minimum 3 sources per class. File < 500 lines.

## Architecture

```
data/intelligence/asset-classes.json    ← main database
data/intelligence/asset-class-schema.json  ← JSON schema for validation
```

Single flat JSON array. No nested hierarchies — each asset class is self-contained. Schema file enables validation in tests.

